# IslandInk: steps from parity/shell_modules_menubar_IslandInk.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen TESSERA-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ipc recorder screen
wait 2
shot recording-pill
note Material: the recording lead circle is error (red) with an on-error dot
ipc recorder pause
wait 1
shot paused-pill
note paused (grey colour): the lead circle is primary
ipc recorder stop
